{"id": "0b8acc1e-2864-4605-883b-5110ba5a38c9", "slug": "peakpath", "title": "PeakPath", "description": "Peakpath Sleep Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"PeakPath\"\ndescription: \"Peakpath Sleep Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#9BF2C5\"\n  secondary: \"#011A16\"\n  accent: \"#7CEAA9\"\n  background: \"#011A16\"\n  surface: \"#012620\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Instrument Serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# PeakPath\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 242; favorites: 12; remixes: 4.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nPeakpath Sleep Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nPeakPath Home About Blog Book a demo Sleep better. Stay focused. Think sharper. PeakPath helps Big-3 and Big-4 pros boost performance with coaching, wearables, and habit tools. Book a demo Better Sleep 10 minutes for in…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Sleep better. Stay focused. Think sharper..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #9BF2C5, secondary #011A16, accent #7CEAA9, background #011A16, surface #012620, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Instrument Serif for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>PeakPath</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#011a16] text-white antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#9bf2c5] selection:text-[#011a16]\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen w-full\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-6 md:px-12 md:py-8\">\n            <!-- Brand -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl tracking-tight font-medium\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ruler-angular-linear\" class=\"text-2xl rotate-90\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                PeakPath\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Desktop Nav -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full p-1 border border-white/10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-sm font-light text-white transition-colors\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-light text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">About</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-light text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\">Blog</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- CTA -->\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-[#011a16] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">\n                Book a demo\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Toggle -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-white/80 hover:text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Hero -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 w-full max-w-4xl py-12 md:py-0\">\n            \n            <h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6 md:mb-8 text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4\">\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block font-light\">Sleep</div></div>\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block italic font-light text-white/90\">better.</div></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4\">\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block font-light\">Stay</div></div>\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block italic font-light text-white/90\">focused.</div></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-4\">\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block font-light\">Think</div></div>\n                    <div style=\"overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\"><div class=\"reveal-word inline-block italic font-light text-white/90\">sharper.</div></div>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\" class=\"mb-10 max-w-[500px]\">\n                <p class=\"reveal-line text-lg md:text-xl text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                    PeakPath helps Big-3 and Big-4 pros boost performance with coaching, wearables, and habit tools.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"overflow: hidden;\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"reveal-line inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#9bf2c5] text-[#012620] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm md:text-base font-medium hover:bg-[#7ceaa9] transition-colors w-max\">\n                    Book a demo\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer Pills -->\n        <footer class=\"px-6 py-6 md:px-12 md:py-8 flex flex-nowrap gap-3 md:gap-4 overflow-x-auto w-full\" style=\"scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none;\">\n            <style>footer::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }</style>\n            \n            <div class=\"reveal-pill flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#011a16]/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 px-5 py-3 rounded-full w-max shrink-0\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/80\">Better Sleep</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"reveal-pill flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#011a16]/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 px-5 py-3 rounded-full w-max shrink-0\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/80\">10 minutes for increased calm and focus</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"reveal-pill flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#011a16]/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 px-5 py-3 rounded-full w-max shrink-0\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/80\">20% boost in cognitive performance</span>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Shader Scripts -->\n    <script type=\"x-shader/x-vertex\" id=\"vertexShader\">\n        varying vec2 vUv;\n        void main() {\n            vUv = uv;\n            gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <script type=\"x-shader/x-fragment\" id=\"fragmentShader\">\n        uniform float u_time;\n        uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n        varying vec2 vUv;\n\n        void main() {\n            vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n            float x = uv.x;\n            float y = uv.y;\n\n            // Palette\n            vec3 darkBg = vec3(0.004, 0.10, 0.08);     // Very dark teal left\n            vec3 midTeal = vec3(0.01, 0.35, 0.28);     // Mid teal\n            vec3 brightYellow = vec3(0.75, 1.0, 0.25); // Bright yellow/green beam\n            vec3 mintGreen = vec3(0.18, 0.85, 0.60);   // Mint right side\n\n            // Create wavy distortion for vertical lines\n            float noiseX = sin(y * 8.0 + u_time * 0.4) * 0.03 + sin(y * 3.0 - u_time * 0.2) * 0.05;\n            float distX = x + noiseX;\n\n            // Generate fine vertical gradient strips\n            float stripePattern = sin(distX * 800.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n            float softStripe = pow(stripePattern, 0.4);\n\n            // Base color mix left to right\n            vec3 color = mix(darkBg, midTeal, smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, distX));\n\n            // The bright vertical beam\n            float beamCenter = 0.52 + sin(y * 2.0 + u_time * 0.5) * 0.02; // Slight sway\n            float beamIntensity = exp(-pow((distX - beamCenter) * 8.0, 2.0));\n            color = mix(color, brightYellow, beamIntensity * 0.9);\n\n            // Right side mint gradient\n            float rightMix = smoothstep(0.55, 1.0, distX);\n            color = mix(color, mintGreen, rightMix * 0.8);\n\n            // Apply stripe texture variation\n            color *= mix(0.85, 1.05, softStripe);\n\n            // Subtle vertical vignette/fade at bottom to ground it\n            color *= mix(0.6, 1.0, pow(y, 0.5));\n\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Main Logic -->\n    <script>\n        // 1. WebGL Background Setup\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });\n            \n            const setSize = () => {\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                if(material) {\n                    material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                }\n            };\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            \n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                vertexShader: document.getElementById('vertexShader').textContent,\n                fragmentShader: document.getElementById('fragmentShader').textContent,\n                uniforms: {\n                    u_time: { value: 0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) }\n                }\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n            setSize();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', setSize);\n\n            let time = 0;\n            const animate = () => {\n                time += 0.01;\n                material.uniforms.u_time.value = time;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n            animate();\n        };\n\n        // 2. GSAP Animations\n        const initAnimations = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Word Reveal\n            gsap.fromTo(\".reveal-word\", \n                { y: \"110%\", rotationZ: 2 }, \n                { \n                    y: \"0%\", \n                    rotationZ: 0,\n                    duration: 1.2, \n                    stagger: 0.1, \n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \"main\",\n                        start: \"top 80%\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n\n            // Line/Button Reveal\n            gsap.fromTo(\".reveal-line\", \n                { y: \"100%\", opacity: 0 }, \n                { \n                    y: \"0%\", \n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 1.2, \n                    stagger: 0.15, \n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    delay: 0.6,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \"main\",\n                        start: \"top 80%\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n\n            // Bottom Pills Reveal\n            gsap.fromTo(\".reveal-pill\", \n                { y: 20, opacity: 0 }, \n                { \n                    y: 0, \n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 1, \n                    stagger: 0.1, \n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    delay: 1,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \"footer\",\n                        start: \"top 100%\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initAnimations();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "peakpath.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/peakpath.jpg", "source_name": "peakpath-DESIGN.md", "views": 311, "forks": 9, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:42:17.84614+00:00"}